<sect2 id="md__2home_2umar_2Desktop_2WorkShop_2GLL_2README_1autotoc_md36">
<title>What is Centry</title>
<para>Centry is a simple, lightweight program that lets you access the inside of a running Docker container just like in interactive tty mode. The only prerequisite is to have Docker already available on your system.</para>
</sect2>
<sect2 id="md__2home_2umar_2Desktop_2WorkShop_2GLL_2README_1autotoc_md37">
